#35000
The Southern Gate of Gnishmire~
   You stand in the southern gate of the gnomish city of Gnishmire.  Its
iron-banded doors are fitted with gears and counterweights so that a
single gnome can swing them shut, and far to the north the clock tower
of the City Hall rises above a forest of smoking chimneys.  The city
lies north, and a path leads south onto the plain.
~
