#35001
Before the Southern Gate of Gnishmire~
   You are standing just inside the southern gate of Gnishmire, where
gnomes file past on their way in and out of town, many pushing handcarts
that squeak and clatter.  To the north you can make out the clock tower
of the City Hall, and the perimeter road runs east and west.  To the
south the gate opens onto a vast plain.
