#35002
South Main Road of Gnishmire~
   You stand on the busy Main Road of Gnishmire, its cobbles worn smooth
by countless small feet.  To the north the clock tower of the City Hall
rises over the square, and to the east and west stand private houses.
To the south lies the city's southern gate.
