#35003
The Center Square of Gnishmire~
   This is the heart of Gnishmire's center square, busy with folk in
every direction: merchants hawking their wares and gnomes arguing loudly
about inventions that will surely change the world.  A brass drinking
fountain shaped like a clockwork fish burbles in the middle of the
square.  To the north stands the City Hall, and the square spreads east
and west, while the Main Road leads south toward the gate.
~
