#35004
The Gnishmire City Hall~
   You duck through the low entryway into the city hall, the busiest
building in the city.  Gnomes hurry everywhere with armfuls of papers,
making sure the city stays in order, and overhead the great clock ticks
so loudly that you can feel it in your teeth.  A bulletin board holds
notes about the city and the surrounding lands.  To the north lies the
busy post office, and the square lies south.
~
